c) Wind load is taken as per Part C ‘Structural Design, Section 1 Loads and Load Effects’ of this NBCS for structures with large openings, that is, openings larger than 20 percent of wall area (or as the case may be);
d) Stresses developed in curved lamella planks should not exceed the allowable safe stresses of timber species used;
